async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Necropolis icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Necropolis_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2d/Stage_Necropolis_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073022\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dank_Depths\" title=\"Dank Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Dank Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dank Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073222\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Womb\" title=\"Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Stage_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073122\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utero\" title=\"Utero\"><img alt=\"Stage Utero icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Utero icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Utero_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3d/Stage_Utero_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073102\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarred_Womb\" title=\"Scarred Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/af/Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073303\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Room\" title=\"Dark Room\"><img alt=\"Stage Dark Room icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dark Room icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/60/Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072941\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Room\" title=\"Boss Room\"><img alt=\"Boss Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Boss_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102031\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Embryos</b> are monsters that hop around the room, dealing contact damage. They are relatively harmless as they do not move much from their position and don’t target the player.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-1\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Removed in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(in Rebirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc na indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_na_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/25/Dlc_na_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821200142\" /></span></span>  Embryos count as the &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blastocyst\" title=\"Blastocyst\"><img alt=\"Boss Blastocyst ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Blastocyst ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Blastocyst_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/d/d9/Boss_Blastocyst_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821195556\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blastocyst\" title=\"Blastocyst\">Blastocyst</a> boss. Blastocyst still splits into Embryos.</li>\n<li>Embryos bear a strong resemblance to Spewer: the star of the game Spewer which was also created by Edmund Mcmillen, the maker of <i>The Binding of Isaac</i>.</li>\n<li>In the original <i>The Binding of Isaac</i>, they have health bars (like <a href=\"/wiki/Mini-boss\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mini-boss\">mini-bosses</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Boss\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Boss\">bosses</a> have).</li>\n<li>Embryos can often be seen in rooms with <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Blood Donation Machine\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blood Donation Machine.png\" data-image-key=\"Blood_Donation_Machine.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6e/Blood_Donation_Machine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821075842\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Machines#Blood_Donation_Machine\" title=\"Machines\">Blood Donation Machines</a>.</li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Bestiary\" title=\"Bestiary\">Bestiary</a>, Embryos have a unique appearance in which they're smiling.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span>\n</th></tr>\n<t